  "title": "Osso Buco",
  "description": "Osso Buco is an Italian dish made with veal shanks, browned and simmered with tomatoes and vegetables. Traditionally garnished with a mix of chopped raw garlic, parsley, and lemon zest.",
  "authors": [
    "Amy Augustyniak"
